# dependencies / build output from the host (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# tests / reports
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/playwright/.cache
**/storybook-static

# local env & secrets (baked defaults live in docker-compose.yml)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# vcs / editors / misc
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/*.log
docs
results
README.md
